  "title": "Asparagus Roll Ups",
  "description": "A savory bacon and chive filling makes these quick asparagus roll-ups extra-flavorful.",
  "authors": [
    "luckoftheIrish"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-08-29T21:26:22-04:00",
